1
00:00:01,750 --> 00:00:03,460
[thudding]

2
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,720
-[banging]
-[grunting]

3
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:12,510
[monster screeching]

4
00:00:12,550 --> 00:00:14,350
-[MAN 1] We're doomed!
-[MAN 2] It's breaking!

5
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,390
[all screaming]

6
00:00:21,610 --> 00:00:23,570
[grunts]

7
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:29,740
Sally forth, my royal subjects
need you!

8
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:30,740
[Tatsuya growls]

9
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:31,910
[Tatsuya grunting]

10
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:33,780
[monster growls]

11
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:35,240
[Tatsuya yelling]

12
00:00:38,210 --> 00:00:39,750
[monsters growling]

13
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:46,210
[Tatsuya grunts]

14
00:00:49,630 --> 00:00:53,010
[Tatsuya yelling]

15
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:55,850
[grunts]

16
00:00:57,430 --> 00:00:59,230
[all gasping]

17
00:00:59,270 --> 00:01:01,440
[MAN 3] He's incredible.

18
00:01:03,060 --> 00:01:05,690
[XYLO] This battle is over!

19
00:01:13,950 --> 00:01:15,410
[NORGALLE] You are safe now.

20
00:01:15,830 --> 00:01:18,330
My good people, rest easy.

21
00:01:18,370 --> 00:01:21,080
We shall leave this mine
together with due haste.

22
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:24,500
And you will all be handsomely
rewarded for your service.

23
00:01:26,590 --> 00:01:29,300
[♪ opening theme song playing]

24
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:01,390
[FOREMAN 1] Honestly,
we didn't expect help to come.

25
00:03:01,430 --> 00:03:02,680
[XYLO] I don't blame you.

26
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:04,600
We were sent
by the Holy Knights.

27
00:03:04,640 --> 00:03:07,600
I need all of you men
to arm yourselves.

28
00:03:07,650 --> 00:03:09,190
King Norgalle there,

29
00:03:09,230 --> 00:03:11,530
he's a sacred seal specialist.

30
00:03:11,730 --> 00:03:13,030
[FOREMAN 2] A King?

31
00:03:13,900 --> 00:03:16,030
[NORGALLE] Down here,
without any sunlight

32
00:03:16,070 --> 00:03:17,070
to power them,

33
00:03:17,110 --> 00:03:19,570
sacred seals
consume energy fast.

34
00:03:19,620 --> 00:03:22,490
The luminescence that is stored
within any object

35
00:03:22,540 --> 00:03:24,080
is finite by nature.

36
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:26,120
As such, the sacred seal

37
00:03:26,170 --> 00:03:28,540
will have a limited number
of uses.

38
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:31,920
That said, if I carve a seal,

39
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,960
its energy consumption
is vastly lower

40
00:03:34,010 --> 00:03:36,800
than the mass-produced variety
you may have seen,

41
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:39,850
and its effectiveness
is greatly improved.

42
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:44,310
A testament to my status
as the one true king.

43
00:03:44,350 --> 00:03:47,730
Now, Xylo, how long
can we keep fighting?

44
00:03:47,770 --> 00:03:48,850
[XYLO] Hm.

45
00:03:49,150 --> 00:03:50,520
Good question.

46
00:03:51,650 --> 00:03:52,980
[MAN 1] What's that clasp?

47
00:03:53,030 --> 00:03:54,030
Pardon?

48
00:03:54,070 --> 00:03:57,240
[MAN 1] Oh, sorry.
I was just curious.

49
00:03:57,280 --> 00:04:00,870
This thing gauges the amount
of luminescence in my body.

50
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:03,910
The light becomes dimmer
when I'm in short supply.

51
00:04:03,950 --> 00:04:05,830
You're blessed
with much luminescence,

52
00:04:05,870 --> 00:04:08,120
a great deal more
than the average man.

53
00:04:08,170 --> 00:04:10,290
As expected of my elite guard.

54
00:04:10,330 --> 00:04:13,290
I'm truly honored
by your recognition.

55
00:04:15,250 --> 00:04:18,380
[XYLO] But I'm afraid we can't
hold out much longer.

56
00:04:23,930 --> 00:04:26,520
The order to withdraw
came too late.

57
00:04:26,770 --> 00:04:29,390
It's always us lowly workers
who are the last ones

58
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:30,770
to be informed.

59
00:04:32,810 --> 00:04:33,820
Thank you.

60
00:04:33,860 --> 00:04:36,030
It was kind
to share your water.

61
00:04:36,070 --> 00:04:37,490
You keep it.

62
00:04:37,530 --> 00:04:38,860
[gasps softly]

63
00:04:39,030 --> 00:04:40,110
Hmm.

64
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:43,700
We're all grateful
for what you've done.

65
00:04:43,740 --> 00:04:46,040
[XYLO] Are these
the only survivors?

66
00:04:46,080 --> 00:04:47,750
I expected more.

67
00:04:48,460 --> 00:04:52,420
There used to be 50 of us back
before this horrific mess began.

68
00:04:52,460 --> 00:04:55,210
But then, one of my men
suddenly started hearing

69
00:04:55,250 --> 00:04:56,260
a strange voice.

70
00:04:56,300 --> 00:04:57,760
A voice?

71
00:04:57,800 --> 00:05:00,340
That's right. And one night
while the rest of us slept,

72
00:05:00,380 --> 00:05:02,890
he wandered off.
When he returned,

73
00:05:02,930 --> 00:05:05,260
he had transformed
into a monster.

74
00:05:07,140 --> 00:05:08,480
That's why...

75
00:05:09,350 --> 00:05:10,690
we did it.

76
00:05:12,650 --> 00:05:14,940
I swear we had no choice.

77
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:21,360
[NORGALLE]
Does everyone have a weapon?

78
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:24,370
The time has arrived.
Prepare for battle!

79
00:05:24,410 --> 00:05:25,830
[indistinct chatter]

80
00:05:25,870 --> 00:05:27,740
Tatsuya shall lead the way!

81
00:05:27,790 --> 00:05:29,540
And you, I need you--

82
00:05:29,580 --> 00:05:30,830
I'm well aware.

83
00:05:30,870 --> 00:05:33,000
Ensuring our retreat
goes smoothly

84
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:35,040
will be disgustingly difficult.

85
00:05:35,090 --> 00:05:38,340
I'll stay back
and guard the rear.

86
00:05:38,460 --> 00:05:39,630
Gentlemen,

87
00:05:39,670 --> 00:05:41,760
I ask that you watch
each other's backs.

88
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,640
Whatever we face,
I refuse to leave

89
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:45,260
even a single man behind.

90
00:05:45,300 --> 00:05:47,180
[indistinct chatter]

91
00:05:47,220 --> 00:05:49,600
Xylo, upon our
triumphant return,

92
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:52,190
I shall grant you the title
of commander-in-chief.

93
00:05:52,230 --> 00:05:54,190
Honor and glory await you.

94
00:05:54,230 --> 00:05:56,480
Thank you. I can hardly wait.

95
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:57,980
-[rumbling]
-[men exclaim]

96
00:05:58,030 --> 00:05:59,440
-[MAN 1] What is that?
-[MAN 2] Oh, no.

97
00:05:59,940 --> 00:06:02,360
But we haven't even tried
to leave yet!

98
00:06:02,700 --> 00:06:04,030
[monsters growling]

99
00:06:04,070 --> 00:06:06,830
[grunting, panting]

100
00:06:06,870 --> 00:06:09,620
-[XYLO] Get up!
-[MAN 2] Uh?

101
00:06:09,660 --> 00:06:13,000
Unless you wanna die,
protect yourselves!

102
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,420
[yells, grunts]

103
00:06:14,460 --> 00:06:16,420
[monsters growling]

104
00:06:18,420 --> 00:06:19,460
[grunts]

105
00:06:21,550 --> 00:06:22,760
Forget the old plan.

106
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:24,590
We'll stay here
and hold the line.

107
00:06:24,630 --> 00:06:25,590
Take them out!

108
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:27,300
[MAN 3] That's impossible.

109
00:06:27,350 --> 00:06:29,060
We're outnumbered!

110
00:06:29,100 --> 00:06:30,520
[monsters growling]

111
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:31,890
Well, damn.

112
00:06:31,930 --> 00:06:34,520
Now this finally feels
like a proper punishment.

113
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:37,360
[NORGALLE] Let us decide
the order of our deaths.

114
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:39,770
You shall have the honor
of dying first, Xylo.

115
00:06:39,820 --> 00:06:42,190
Greatly appreciated,
Your Majesty.

116
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:44,950
[NORGALLE] I die next,
followed by Tatsuya.

117
00:06:45,110 --> 00:06:47,740
The lives of my kingdom's
servants are at stake.

118
00:06:47,780 --> 00:06:50,450
Our lives are just meaningless
fodder in comparison.

119
00:06:50,490 --> 00:06:51,450
[all gasp]

120
00:06:51,490 --> 00:06:52,950
[monsters growling]

121
00:06:53,910 --> 00:06:56,170
You're one hell of a monarch!

122
00:06:57,630 --> 00:06:59,630
[indistinct chatter]

123
00:07:05,130 --> 00:07:07,390
Dismissed.
Return to your post.

124
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:08,640
[HOLY KNIGHT] Right!

125
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:15,730
[Teoritta groans]

126
00:07:15,770 --> 00:07:18,480
She's been that way
since her hero left.

127
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:20,110
Morose and out of sorts,

128
00:07:20,150 --> 00:07:22,150
clearly no use as a weapon.

129
00:07:22,190 --> 00:07:24,570
We'll go when preparations
are complete.

130
00:07:24,610 --> 00:07:26,240
The Demon Lord will fall.

131
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,700
[monsters screeching]

132
00:07:32,740 --> 00:07:34,580
[XYLO]
Patch up whoever's bleeding.

133
00:07:34,620 --> 00:07:36,210
Just one sip of water each.

134
00:07:36,250 --> 00:07:38,380
[groaning]

135
00:07:38,420 --> 00:07:40,000
[indistinct chatter]

136
00:07:40,540 --> 00:07:42,550
Try not to get too comfortable.

137
00:07:42,590 --> 00:07:44,970
Get back on your feet
as soon as you're able.

138
00:07:45,010 --> 00:07:46,840
[MAN 1] Please, I can't move.

139
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:49,550
-[MAN 2] My legs are throbbing.
-[MAN 3] I can't go on.

140
00:07:49,590 --> 00:07:53,010
[XYLO] Complaining won't help.
Would you prefer to die?

141
00:07:53,060 --> 00:07:54,810
[indistinct chatter]

142
00:07:55,140 --> 00:07:56,600
[NORGALLE] Gentlemen...

143
00:07:58,650 --> 00:08:00,150
I know your hearts.

144
00:08:00,190 --> 00:08:02,230
You risk your lives
tearing down walls

145
00:08:02,270 --> 00:08:04,110
serving as this kingdom's
lifeblood,

146
00:08:04,150 --> 00:08:06,950
and do so with hardly
a word of recognition.

147
00:08:06,990 --> 00:08:08,450
So I know...

148
00:08:08,490 --> 00:08:12,240
fear may tempt,
but it shall never poison you.

149
00:08:12,330 --> 00:08:13,450
♪

150
00:08:13,490 --> 00:08:14,870
Now...

151
00:08:14,910 --> 00:08:17,290
arise and fight.

152
00:08:19,290 --> 00:08:20,540
[foreman grunts softly]

153
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:25,500
I suppose if you believe
in all of us,

154
00:08:25,550 --> 00:08:27,090
we'll keep fighting.

155
00:08:27,340 --> 00:08:29,510
Didn't say that after my speech.

156
00:08:29,550 --> 00:08:32,100
[FOREMAN] About that seal etched
around your neck...

157
00:08:32,140 --> 00:08:34,850
I know what it means.
You're heroes, aren't you?

158
00:08:34,890 --> 00:08:37,100
That's right. It's no secret.

159
00:08:37,140 --> 00:08:38,560
Assume you also know

160
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:40,810
that heroes are
the world's vilest criminals.

161
00:08:40,850 --> 00:08:42,810
Whatever evil deeds
you may have committed

162
00:08:42,860 --> 00:08:45,610
in your old life,
you still came to rescue us.

163
00:08:45,650 --> 00:08:48,610
You didn't just write us off
as expendable.

164
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:51,160
And that's worth a lot.

165
00:08:51,490 --> 00:08:55,200
Enough to inspire us to seek out
a noble way to die.

166
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,450
Screw that plan.

167
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:58,790
You aren't dying here,
nobly or not.

168
00:08:58,830 --> 00:08:59,870
Indeed.

169
00:08:59,910 --> 00:09:02,130
Your fierce devotion
to this kingdom,

170
00:09:02,170 --> 00:09:04,380
the long years spent
toiling away

171
00:09:04,420 --> 00:09:05,880
in dirt and sweat...

172
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:07,840
Your lives are precious.

173
00:09:08,470 --> 00:09:10,260
And worth saving.

174
00:09:10,300 --> 00:09:12,930
I won't let them be stolen away.

175
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,930
-[rumbling]
-[gasping]

176
00:09:19,980 --> 00:09:22,150
[Tatsuya grunting]

177
00:09:22,190 --> 00:09:24,190
Dammit. If we had a probe seal,

178
00:09:24,230 --> 00:09:26,400
we would at least know
how many there are.

179
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,780
[men grunting]

180
00:09:27,820 --> 00:09:29,360
-[MAN 1] Let's do this.
-I ain't dying just yet.

181
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:31,150
Ready? Brace!

182
00:09:32,410 --> 00:09:33,490
[monsters screeching]

183
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:38,120
They're going left!
Hold them off!

184
00:09:41,370 --> 00:09:43,460
-[monsters growling]
-[man whimpering]

185
00:09:45,790 --> 00:09:47,630
[yelling]

186
00:09:54,050 --> 00:09:55,180
[BOTH] Hmm.

187
00:09:55,220 --> 00:09:56,850
[both yelling]

188
00:09:59,060 --> 00:10:00,480
[monster screeching]

189
00:10:01,020 --> 00:10:02,730
Good work, now keep it up!

190
00:10:02,770 --> 00:10:04,600
-[XYLO] Uh?
-[Norgalle grunts]

191
00:10:05,230 --> 00:10:08,190
[grunts] No matter what,
you must keep fighting!

192
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:09,780
[Tatsuya grunts]

193
00:10:09,820 --> 00:10:11,400
Majesty!

194
00:10:12,030 --> 00:10:14,070
-[monsters screeching]
-Die!

195
00:10:18,700 --> 00:10:19,950
[men grunting]

196
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,250
[BOTH] Huh?

197
00:10:21,330 --> 00:10:22,410
[both grunting]

198
00:10:22,460 --> 00:10:24,460
-Dammit!
-[BOTH] Foreman!

199
00:10:25,290 --> 00:10:27,170
-[monster screeching]
-[foreman grunts]

200
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:31,590
[foreman whimpering]

201
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:37,850
♪

202
00:10:43,310 --> 00:10:44,810
[both gasp]

203
00:10:45,770 --> 00:10:48,570
[panting]

204
00:10:48,610 --> 00:10:51,440
I trust you shall forgive
my delayed arrival.

205
00:10:52,150 --> 00:10:55,070
The Goddess of Swords, Teoritta.

206
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:57,280
I grace you with my presence!

207
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:58,490
[chuckles]

208
00:10:59,910 --> 00:11:01,580
[TEORITTA]
No need to hold back.

209
00:11:01,620 --> 00:11:05,960
Rejoice. You have permission
to extol my glorious strength.

210
00:11:06,210 --> 00:11:07,710
[Xylo grunts]

211
00:11:07,750 --> 00:11:10,840
Dear goddess, I see you have
come to bless our endeavors.

212
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:12,710
You have my sincerest thanks.

213
00:11:12,760 --> 00:11:14,510
It delights me
to assist your cause.

214
00:11:14,550 --> 00:11:16,430
Between my knight's skill
and my blessings,

215
00:11:16,470 --> 00:11:18,090
your victory is now assured.

216
00:11:19,180 --> 00:11:22,180
[NORGALLE] Brave men,
we must construct a fence.

217
00:11:22,220 --> 00:11:24,680
I will engrave the swords
with sacred seals.

218
00:11:24,730 --> 00:11:26,940
When I am finished,
plant them in the ground.

219
00:11:26,980 --> 00:11:29,860
-[MEN] Sir!
-[Teoritta chuckles]

220
00:11:29,900 --> 00:11:31,400
[XYLO] What are you doing here?

221
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:33,610
I left you
with the Holy Knights.

222
00:11:33,650 --> 00:11:35,400
I slipped through their fingers.

223
00:11:35,450 --> 00:11:37,990
Their vigilant eyes were
no match for my cunning.

224
00:11:38,030 --> 00:11:39,320
Now, Xylo,

225
00:11:39,370 --> 00:11:42,040
lavish your praise
upon my head.

226
00:11:42,740 --> 00:11:44,910
Praise you? Hell no.

227
00:11:44,950 --> 00:11:48,630
Whyever not? Punishment?
For arriving so belatedly?

228
00:11:48,670 --> 00:11:50,670
Yet I am not to blame!

229
00:11:50,710 --> 00:11:53,460
For it was you who chose
to abandon your goddess.

230
00:11:53,510 --> 00:11:56,510
Truly, it was unbearable.
My errant knight plea--

231
00:11:56,550 --> 00:11:57,930
Don't you listen?

232
00:11:57,970 --> 00:12:00,260
I'm not going
to use your divine power

233
00:12:00,300 --> 00:12:01,760
to complete this mission.

234
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:03,310
[Teoritta gasps]

235
00:12:05,350 --> 00:12:07,100
[TEORITTA] I am at a loss.

236
00:12:07,310 --> 00:12:10,610
How can I grant your wish
unless you give it voice?

237
00:12:11,690 --> 00:12:13,270
[XYLO] I'll tell you my wish.

238
00:12:13,940 --> 00:12:17,950
Stop chasing martyrdom for glory
or in service of others.

239
00:12:18,150 --> 00:12:20,700
Stay alive,
even if you're useless.

240
00:12:22,870 --> 00:12:24,660
[Teoritta exclaims]

241
00:12:24,700 --> 00:12:25,950
[chuckles softly]

242
00:12:26,710 --> 00:12:30,500
How lovely, yet your beautiful
words do not deter me one bit.

243
00:12:30,540 --> 00:12:32,920
They prove you
are worthy of my sacrifice.

244
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:34,250
[Xylo gasps]

245
00:12:34,340 --> 00:12:36,340
[TEORITTA] You strive
to keep me at a distance.

246
00:12:36,380 --> 00:12:38,930
A desperate ploy to protect
my well-being, is it not?

247
00:12:38,970 --> 00:12:40,800
You and your damn theory
can piss off!

248
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:42,260
How fortuitous that even

249
00:12:42,300 --> 00:12:45,140
your most callous opinions
about me are irrelevant.

250
00:12:45,180 --> 00:12:46,350
[XYLO] Are they?

251
00:12:46,390 --> 00:12:48,230
I am a goddess, after all.

252
00:12:48,270 --> 00:12:51,310
The whole reason I exist
is to be of use to others.

253
00:12:51,350 --> 00:12:53,860
-I covet praise and exaltation.
-There. Finally got it!

254
00:12:53,900 --> 00:12:55,860
[TEORITTA]
Nothing less will do!

255
00:12:55,900 --> 00:12:58,900
Even if this desire
is nothing more than a symptom

256
00:12:58,950 --> 00:13:01,780
of my nature,
that does not alter my wish.

257
00:13:01,820 --> 00:13:03,950
To pursue a glorious life,

258
00:13:03,990 --> 00:13:05,870
and noble death.

259
00:13:07,370 --> 00:13:09,710
You shall find this hard
to accept.

260
00:13:09,750 --> 00:13:11,500
Yet here it is, my knight.

261
00:13:11,540 --> 00:13:14,500
Even you cannot stop
my heart from yearning.

262
00:13:14,630 --> 00:13:16,500
[Xylo groaning softly]

263
00:13:16,550 --> 00:13:19,510
-[rumbling]
-[gasps]

264
00:13:19,550 --> 00:13:22,220
Another wave incoming.
Men to your posts!

265
00:13:22,260 --> 00:13:23,510
Remain within the fence!

266
00:13:23,890 --> 00:13:25,800
They can't get through
the ground here.

267
00:13:28,180 --> 00:13:29,850
You had better stay back.

268
00:13:29,890 --> 00:13:31,480
[TEORITTA] Xylo,
if you disapprove

269
00:13:31,520 --> 00:13:33,650
my bent towards
self-sacrifice...

270
00:13:34,060 --> 00:13:35,110
It is quite simple.

271
00:13:35,150 --> 00:13:37,650
You must protect me
at all costs.

272
00:13:39,570 --> 00:13:42,070
You make it sound so easy.

273
00:13:45,070 --> 00:13:47,490
I suppose that's exactly
what I'll have to do.

274
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:52,710
Take this.

275
00:13:55,380 --> 00:13:56,750
And this!

276
00:13:58,420 --> 00:14:01,010
-There's more an...
-[high-pitched ringing]

277
00:14:01,050 --> 00:14:02,930
[men screaming]

278
00:14:03,930 --> 00:14:05,180
I hear it.

279
00:14:05,220 --> 00:14:06,850
Is that the voice?

280
00:14:06,890 --> 00:14:09,680
[men grunting, screaming]

281
00:14:10,310 --> 00:14:11,930
[Norgalle grunting]

282
00:14:15,940 --> 00:14:18,530
[Tatsuya grunts, yells]

283
00:14:18,570 --> 00:14:20,490
[Xylo grunting]

284
00:14:21,440 --> 00:14:22,820
[TEORITTA] My knight!

285
00:14:23,700 --> 00:14:25,370
[XYLO] I'm fine.

286
00:14:25,570 --> 00:14:26,700
[Teoritta grunts]

287
00:14:29,620 --> 00:14:31,910
My powers of protection
and healing.

288
00:14:31,950 --> 00:14:34,370
May they quieten the cacophony.

289
00:14:34,580 --> 00:14:35,670
[Xylo grunts]

290
00:14:35,710 --> 00:14:37,590
I never asked you to help me.

291
00:14:37,750 --> 00:14:38,920
[Xylo grunting]

292
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:41,090
My poor knight, you are...

293
00:14:41,550 --> 00:14:43,510
I'll have to
hear you out afterward.

294
00:14:43,550 --> 00:14:44,630
It is here.

295
00:14:44,680 --> 00:14:46,720
The source of
the Demon Lord Blight.

296
00:14:46,800 --> 00:14:48,010
♪

297
00:14:48,510 --> 00:14:51,310
[TEORITTA] The true battle
shall now begin.

298
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:04,490
[WOMAN] You...

299
00:15:05,240 --> 00:15:06,740
Yes.

300
00:15:06,780 --> 00:15:08,240
You...

301
00:15:08,700 --> 00:15:10,950
I found you.

302
00:15:11,830 --> 00:15:13,040
[Teoritta gasps]

303
00:15:13,870 --> 00:15:15,750
[WOMAN] I found you!

304
00:15:15,790 --> 00:15:17,080
[XYLO] That's it.

305
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:19,040
Demon Lord Lotus.

306
00:15:19,090 --> 00:15:22,710
-[high-pitched ringing]
-[all screaming]

307
00:15:24,090 --> 00:15:26,380
[screaming]

308
00:15:26,430 --> 00:15:28,600
[man groaning] The voice.

309
00:15:28,640 --> 00:15:30,510
I hear it.

310
00:15:30,560 --> 00:15:31,600
The voice!

311
00:15:31,640 --> 00:15:32,720
Stay where you are!

312
00:15:32,770 --> 00:15:34,390
That thing will corrupt
your soul.

313
00:15:34,430 --> 00:15:37,650
Quiet! The voice is trying
to tell me something important!

314
00:15:37,690 --> 00:15:38,810
[grunting]

315
00:15:38,860 --> 00:15:40,230
[XYLO] Stop it!

316
00:15:42,780 --> 00:15:44,940
Damn it. Hey!

317
00:15:44,990 --> 00:15:46,910
[NORGALLE] I swear.

318
00:15:46,950 --> 00:15:48,200
You'll die.

319
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:52,160
How dare you seek
to lead my people astray!

320
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:55,830
Filthy thief!
You contemptible usurper!

321
00:15:55,870 --> 00:15:59,460
Teoritta, leaving this fence
is a death sentence.

322
00:15:59,500 --> 00:16:02,130
We'll have to support Tatsuya
from here!

323
00:16:02,170 --> 00:16:04,130
[Tatsuya grunting]

324
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:07,050
Do you believe that
he can succeed alone?

325
00:16:07,090 --> 00:16:09,970
He doesn't seem to be
affected by the tinnitus.

326
00:16:10,010 --> 00:16:12,510
Hurry, I need you to make
more swords for me.

327
00:16:12,560 --> 00:16:13,890
Inspired idea!

328
00:16:13,930 --> 00:16:16,770
You should rely on me
as much as possible!

329
00:16:18,140 --> 00:16:20,730
It's been a while
since I covered someone else.

330
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:23,610
[Tatsuya grunting]

331
00:16:23,650 --> 00:16:25,030
Keep it up, Tatsuya!

332
00:16:25,110 --> 00:16:27,280
Go and slay the Demon Lord!

333
00:16:28,950 --> 00:16:30,070
[Tatsuya grunting]

334
00:16:32,450 --> 00:16:35,500
[Lotus screeching]

335
00:16:35,540 --> 00:16:37,040
♪

336
00:16:37,790 --> 00:16:38,710
You've got this!

337
00:16:38,750 --> 00:16:40,880
-Keep going!
-[Tatsuya yelling]

338
00:16:44,380 --> 00:16:45,510
[Tatsuya grunts]

339
00:16:45,550 --> 00:16:48,470
Need more swords!
A storm of blades!

340
00:16:49,380 --> 00:16:50,470
Granted!

341
00:16:50,930 --> 00:16:53,470
[Xylo grunting, yelling]

342
00:16:57,520 --> 00:16:59,190
[Tatsuya grunting]

343
00:16:59,230 --> 00:17:00,270
[Tatsuya yelling]

344
00:17:02,310 --> 00:17:04,270
Slice it in two!

345
00:17:07,150 --> 00:17:08,530
[both gasp]

346
00:17:12,070 --> 00:17:14,240
That body. It was a decoy.

347
00:17:14,370 --> 00:17:15,410
Xylo, look!

348
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:18,580
[monster growls]

349
00:17:18,620 --> 00:17:20,670
There it is.
The core. [gasps]

350
00:17:23,080 --> 00:17:25,040
A hell of a time to run out.

351
00:17:26,250 --> 00:17:29,090
There it is! Go and support
the goddess and miners!

352
00:17:29,760 --> 00:17:31,800
-[high-pitched ringing]
-[Xylo grunts]

353
00:17:31,840 --> 00:17:33,720
Stop it! Stay back!

354
00:17:33,760 --> 00:17:34,890
[knights screaming]

355
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:39,430
[grunts] What is this?

356
00:17:40,020 --> 00:17:41,060
[all screaming]

357
00:17:41,100 --> 00:17:42,940
[HOLY KNIGHT]
The voice is calling.

358
00:17:42,980 --> 00:17:44,480
[grunting]

359
00:17:47,230 --> 00:17:48,860
-[XYLO] Dammit all.
-[gasps]

360
00:17:49,820 --> 00:17:51,320
[Xylo grunting]

361
00:17:58,450 --> 00:17:59,910
[all screaming]

362
00:18:00,500 --> 00:18:01,960
[choking]

363
00:18:04,710 --> 00:18:06,630
[Norgalle grunting]

364
00:18:09,550 --> 00:18:10,970
Majesty!

365
00:18:11,970 --> 00:18:15,260
I will protect my people,
even if it kills me!

366
00:18:15,300 --> 00:18:16,930
You shall pay.

367
00:18:16,970 --> 00:18:20,270
The king has spoken,
you filthy usurper!

368
00:18:22,230 --> 00:18:23,730
[Lotus screams]

369
00:18:29,190 --> 00:18:30,940
[XYLO] That's it, Your Majesty!

370
00:18:30,990 --> 00:18:32,110
Burn the core!

371
00:18:32,150 --> 00:18:34,990
You stole my precious people,
you fiend...

372
00:18:35,030 --> 00:18:37,030
[gasps, grunts]

373
00:18:38,120 --> 00:18:39,160
Damn you!

374
00:18:43,750 --> 00:18:45,420
[Tatsuya grunting]

375
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:58,890
-[Xylo gasps]
-Hurry! We'll cover you!

376
00:18:58,930 --> 00:19:00,970
Xylo! My knight.

377
00:19:01,270 --> 00:19:02,680
Put an end to it!

378
00:19:03,270 --> 00:19:04,520
[Xylo grunts]

379
00:19:05,100 --> 00:19:07,520
[XYLO] Burn to death,
you bastard!

380
00:19:08,190 --> 00:19:09,520
[grunts]

381
00:19:10,690 --> 00:19:11,690
[grunts]

382
00:19:11,730 --> 00:19:13,990
What am I supposed to do?

383
00:19:14,450 --> 00:19:15,990
[Norgalle grunting]

384
00:19:21,540 --> 00:19:22,950
You'll pay for this.

385
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:25,250
I swear I'll make you pay!

386
00:19:25,290 --> 00:19:26,460
[grunting]

387
00:19:30,460 --> 00:19:31,630
You'll see.

388
00:19:31,670 --> 00:19:33,710
You shall regret this!

389
00:19:34,340 --> 00:19:36,130
I demand penance in blood

390
00:19:36,170 --> 00:19:38,220
for every subject
that you stole!

391
00:19:38,260 --> 00:19:41,430
[shouts] I'll make you pay!

392
00:19:46,310 --> 00:19:47,980
-[NORGALLE] Norgalle.
-[Norgalle gasps]

393
00:19:48,190 --> 00:19:50,980
Norgalle!
Stay right where you are!

394
00:19:51,020 --> 00:19:53,030
I'm coming to save you!

395
00:19:54,280 --> 00:19:55,990
[Lotus screeches]

396
00:19:58,360 --> 00:19:59,820
Majesty!

397
00:20:02,990 --> 00:20:04,040
[grunts]

398
00:20:04,080 --> 00:20:05,960
You really are
one hell of a king,

399
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:07,120
you know that?

400
00:20:11,710 --> 00:20:14,010
[Lotus screams]

401
00:20:32,360 --> 00:20:34,230
[gasps, pants]

402
00:20:34,320 --> 00:20:35,690
[HOLY KNIGHT 1] Is it over?

403
00:20:35,740 --> 00:20:38,110
[HOLY KNIGHT 2]
The heroes. They did it.

404
00:20:41,370 --> 00:20:43,200
[FOREMAN]
That should stem the bleeding.

405
00:20:43,370 --> 00:20:45,330
[Norgalle grunting]

406
00:20:45,410 --> 00:20:46,830
[NORGALLE] This time,

407
00:20:46,870 --> 00:20:48,290
did I make it?

408
00:20:48,330 --> 00:20:50,120
My people...

409
00:20:50,170 --> 00:20:51,670
I must protect them.

410
00:20:51,710 --> 00:20:55,210
They need their king.
Right? [grunting]

411
00:20:57,340 --> 00:20:59,470
[Tatsuya groans]

412
00:21:04,680 --> 00:21:07,140
The deed is done,
noble knight.

413
00:21:07,730 --> 00:21:09,270
[Xylo sighs]

414
00:21:09,310 --> 00:21:10,690
[XYLO] Yeah.

415
00:21:13,900 --> 00:21:15,440
-[indistinct chatter]
-[CHILD] Mommy!

416
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:17,570
[WOMAN] Thank goodness
you're home safe!

417
00:21:17,610 --> 00:21:19,820
[GIRL] We missed you
so much, Daddy!

418
00:21:19,860 --> 00:21:21,450
[indistinct chatter]

419
00:21:26,540 --> 00:21:27,870
[SIENA] Rajit?

420
00:21:28,450 --> 00:21:31,960
Hear, hear!
Good work, everybody.

421
00:21:32,210 --> 00:21:33,920
-[Venetim gulps]
-[both grunt]

422
00:21:33,960 --> 00:21:35,000
[VENETIM] Ah!

423
00:21:35,170 --> 00:21:37,590
Oh! No need to worry
about the king.

424
00:21:37,630 --> 00:21:40,420
What's left of him has been
sent off to the repair shop.

425
00:21:40,470 --> 00:21:44,640
Though, I imagine he'll receive
a new leg from someone else.

426
00:21:44,680 --> 00:21:46,060
-Maybe?
-[XYLO] I hope they at least

427
00:21:46,100 --> 00:21:47,810
give him the best one
they've got.

428
00:21:47,850 --> 00:21:50,100
The mad king saved
a lot of lives today,

429
00:21:50,140 --> 00:21:52,310
so he deserves some reward
for his trouble.

430
00:21:52,350 --> 00:21:53,770
[WOMAN 1] Heroes?

431
00:21:53,810 --> 00:21:55,820
-[MAN 1] Impossible.
-[MAN 2] Aren't they criminals?

432
00:21:55,860 --> 00:21:56,860
[WOMAN 2] Unbelievable.

433
00:21:56,900 --> 00:21:58,320
[MAN] What really happened?

434
00:21:58,360 --> 00:22:00,490
[all murmuring]

435
00:22:00,530 --> 00:22:01,610
[Xylo scoffs]

436
00:22:01,780 --> 00:22:02,950
[FOREMAN] Don't worry.

437
00:22:02,990 --> 00:22:05,160
I'm certain they'll all
come to understand

438
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:07,330
your kindness
one of these days.

439
00:22:08,700 --> 00:22:10,040
It's no big deal.

440
00:22:10,080 --> 00:22:11,540
We're all used to it.

441
00:22:11,580 --> 00:22:14,210
[FOREMAN] Regardless, no matter
what anyone else says,

442
00:22:14,250 --> 00:22:16,540
you're the reason
we're still alive.

443
00:22:16,590 --> 00:22:17,630
[XYLO] Hmm.

444
00:22:18,000 --> 00:22:20,340
I owe you my life and honor.
Thanks to you,

445
00:22:20,380 --> 00:22:22,550
we didn't die nobly
or otherwise.

446
00:22:23,970 --> 00:22:26,220
Well, thank
His Majesty for that.

447
00:22:26,260 --> 00:22:27,310
I know.

448
00:22:27,350 --> 00:22:29,850
And I will someday.
But on this day,

449
00:22:29,890 --> 00:22:32,100
we get to celebrate
my daughter's birthday

450
00:22:32,140 --> 00:22:33,890
-as a family.
-Go on.

451
00:22:33,940 --> 00:22:36,150
You have something
for him, don't you?

452
00:22:37,110 --> 00:22:38,360
[GIRL] Mm-hm.

453
00:22:39,230 --> 00:22:40,400
Um...

454
00:22:42,700 --> 00:22:45,910
Thank you so much,
Mr. Hero.

455
00:22:45,950 --> 00:22:47,070
[gasps softly]

456
00:22:48,660 --> 00:22:49,910
[exclaims softly]

457
00:22:52,120 --> 00:22:53,210
[TEORITTA] Ahem.

458
00:22:53,250 --> 00:22:55,920
Child, take heed!
It was my blessing

459
00:22:55,960 --> 00:22:57,790
that allowed him
to fight so valiantly.

460
00:22:57,840 --> 00:22:59,590
I am deserving
of your accolades,

461
00:22:59,630 --> 00:23:01,880
and, therefore, first in line
as his goddess.

462
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:03,920
-[parents chuckle]
-What? Goddess?

463
00:23:04,220 --> 00:23:05,220
[XYLO] Enough.

464
00:23:05,260 --> 00:23:07,140
Don't boss around
fellow children.

465
00:23:07,180 --> 00:23:08,970
[Teoritta gasps]
"Fellow children"?

466
00:23:09,010 --> 00:23:11,640
You're calling me a child?
Flagrant insolence!

467
00:23:11,680 --> 00:23:13,600
I urge you to keep
such thoughts to yourself--

468
00:23:13,640 --> 00:23:15,020
[XYLO] Settle down.

469
00:23:18,020 --> 00:23:21,980
I appreciate the gesture,
but it doesn't suit me.

470
00:23:22,440 --> 00:23:25,400
[Teoritta grunting]

471
00:23:25,450 --> 00:23:27,320
-[XYLO] Teoritta.
-[gasps]

472
00:23:27,820 --> 00:23:30,660
You can have it if you want.

473
00:23:30,700 --> 00:23:32,120
[Teoritta exclaims softly]

474
00:23:32,830 --> 00:23:34,960
[chuckles] Yes.

475
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:37,170
It is
a truly charming flower.

476
00:23:37,380 --> 00:23:39,670
[scoffs] Why do kids
love flowers so much?

477
00:23:39,710 --> 00:23:41,090
[Teoritta grunts]

478
00:23:41,130 --> 00:23:43,760
My knight, you shall cease
describing me that way!

479
00:23:43,800 --> 00:23:45,380
It's difficult to quantify

480
00:23:45,420 --> 00:23:47,130
how many regulations
they've broken.

481
00:23:47,180 --> 00:23:49,220
I will see to it that
they get reprimanded.

482
00:23:49,260 --> 00:23:50,550
Hold it right there.

483
00:23:50,850 --> 00:23:52,640
Even if they are criminals,

484
00:23:52,680 --> 00:23:55,180
they still went out of their way
to save lives.

485
00:23:55,230 --> 00:23:57,690
I would say they've earned
a little praise.

486
00:23:57,730 --> 00:23:59,190
They're heroes!

487
00:23:59,230 --> 00:24:01,610
[KIVIA] Better than
a coward waving a crest,

488
00:24:01,650 --> 00:24:04,900
who never does a minute
of actual fighting himself.

489
00:24:04,940 --> 00:24:07,360
[priest gasps, grunts]

490
00:24:11,120 --> 00:24:15,040
[KIVIA] Xylo Forbartz...
the goddess-killer hero.

491
00:24:15,080 --> 00:24:16,120
See?

492
00:24:18,620 --> 00:24:20,040
I adore it,

493
00:24:20,080 --> 00:24:21,960
and you can rest assured
that my knight and I shall--

494
00:24:22,000 --> 00:24:23,460
[XYLO] Come. It's time to go.

495
00:24:23,500 --> 00:24:26,300
[TEORITTA] Now? Surely we have
time for more adulation!

496
00:24:26,340 --> 00:24:27,800
[GIRL] I wanna
talk some more, too!

497
00:24:27,840 --> 00:24:29,800
-[TEORITTA] Of course!
-[Xylo sighs]

